{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Jyu4UjufJ7JwMqigc1znkC","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_3/projects/gen-depth-fingerprint/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"## 核心方向\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 10:08 UTC | 更新原因: D034 rp策略确定 + plan-016 generation 进行中状态更新\\\\n\\\\n递归 LLM 生成链展现 **differential depth response**：central-tendency/diversity 特征随深度漂移，shape 特征近稳态。7-feature ensemble 跨 9 base-model generators / 6 families 验证（D034 确认 8/9 用 rp=1.0，仅 Gemma rp=1.1）。**Primary metric (D017)**: binary LOGO F1（gen-1 vs gen-2+, leak-free）；3-class LOGO F1 supplementary。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿目标\\\\n- **主投: EMNLP 2026 ARR (DDL: 2026-05-25)** — 9 天倒计时\\\\n- **策略**: 9-gen/6-family scope 显著加强论文 contribution，瞄准 accept\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Scope expansion (plan-016) + Round 4 修复收尾\\\\n- **D032**: 三档分类修复完成（Strong/Moderate/Near-stationary）✅\\\\n- **D033→D034**: Plan-016 rp 策略确定 — Llama/Mistral rp=1.0, Gemma rp=1.1\\\\n- **Paper Agent**: W4/W5/W6 完成（三档术语统一 + corpus vs doc + model collapse）✅\\\\n- **Generation 进行中**: 4 GPUs 全满，ETA ~1.5-2h\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n\\\\n**Phase A — Generation 完成后（ETA ~1.5-2h）：**\\\\n- [ ] Llama rp=1.0 完成 → 过滤退化 → 3-ref feature extraction\\\\n- [ ] Mistral rp=1.0 完成 → 过滤退化 → 3-ref feature extraction\\\\n- [ ] Gemma rp=1.0 完成 → 启动 Gemma rp=1.1 生成\\\\n- [ ] Llama rp=1.1 完成 → 3-ref feature extraction\\\\n\\\\n**Phase B — Feature extraction 完成后（ETA ~3-4h from now）：**\\\\n- [ ] 9-gen LOGO evaluation（8 rp=1.0 + Gemma rp=1.1）\\\\n- [ ] rp-LOFO diagnostic: train 8 rp=1.0 → test Gemma rp=1.1 (+ Llama rp=1.1 extra)\\\\n- [ ] 更新 pooled Spearman ρ（9-gen）\\\\n\\\\n**Phase C — 数据确认后：**\\\\n- [ ] 全文 TODO markers 更新（9-gen/6-family 数字）\\\\n- [ ] Table 4 扩展为 9-gen LOGO\\\\n- [ ] Figure 1 更新（如 9-gen pooled ρ 有变化）\\\\n- [ ] Abstract/Intro/Conclusion 更新 scope claim\\\\n\\\\n**Phase D — 最终冲刺：**\\\\n- [ ] Round 5 内部审查\\\\n- [ ] 最终编译 + 提交\\\\n\\\\n## Claim 证据状态\\\\n| Claim | 状态 | 关键证据 |\\\\n|-------|------|---------|\\\\n| 1 — Depth Discriminability | ✅ (6-gen), 🔄 (9-gen pending) | binary F1=0.723 (6-gen LOGO), 9-gen TBD |\\\\n| 2 — Differential Depth Response | ✅ | 三档分类 D032, 3 ref models, 3 prompt types, length-controlled |\\\\n| 3 — Downstream Utility | ⬇️ 降级 (D029) | supplementary analysis only |\\\\n| Baseline comparison | ✅ | 7-feat ≈ 4-det+surface; 贡献在 simplicity + interpretability |\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配: 4× RTX 5090 (autodl-5090: cuda:0-3)\\\\n- 当前: 4/4 占满（Llama×2 + Gemma + Mistral generation）\\\\n- 已消耗: ~70h / 200h\\\\n- 剩余预算充足，可支持 Gemma rp=1.1 + feature extraction + LOGO eval\\\\n\\\\n## rp-LOFO Gate（D033/D034）\\\\n- F1 > 0.70 → Gemma rp=1.1 进 main results，报告 9-gen\\\\n- F1 0.60-0.70 → 灰区，8-gen main + Gemma \\\\\\\"extended validation\\\\\\\"\\\\n- F1 < 0.60 → Gemma appendix only，main 报告 8-gen\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D036 | 2026-05-16 | D036: 撤回 D035，恢复 Llama rp=1.0+filter。最终 8/9 rp=1.0 | plan-016-llama32-3b, plan-016-llama32-3b-rp11 |\\\\n| D035 | 2026-05-16 | D035: D034 修正 — Llama 也需 rp=1.1。最终 7/9 rp=1.0 (原6+ | plan-016-llama32-3b, plan-016-llama32-3b-rp11, plan-016-mistral-7b, plan-016-gemma2-2b |\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-16 | D034: Plan-016 rp 策略修正 — Llama/Mistral 用 rp=1.0（退化 | plan-016-llama32-3b, plan-016-llama32-3b-rp11, plan-016-mistral-7b, plan-016-gemma2-2b |\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-16 | Plan-016 策略：rp=1.1 新模型纳入 main results（9-gen/6-fami | plan-016-llama32-3b-rp11 |\\\\n| D032 | 2026-05-16 | Pooled ρ 修正 → 三档分类替代二分法: strong drift (hapax/TTR/e | spearman_per_generator, plan-014 |\\\\n| D031 | 2026-05-16 | H_min reclassified as drifting feature; shape stat | spearman_per_generator |\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-16 | Round 3 审稿 3.0/Findings: 大幅重写 framing 为 base-model | review-p0a-gen0-leakage, plan-004-v2, review-p1c-qwen06b-instruct |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-16 | Round 3 审稿处理：大幅重写 framing (base-model scope)，downs | review-p1c-qwen06b-instruct, review-p1c-olmo-instruct, plan-004-v2 |\\\\n| D028 | 2026-05-16 | Plan-006-confound-fix results → discussion paragra | plan-006-confound-fix |\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-16 | Plan-012 QLoRA results → appendix: end-to-end fine | plan-012-qwen06b, plan-012-qwen06b-v2 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3685, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ec1innYNP4EdeABFoQ6Ezo","session_id":"45525fff-3840-4650-9f3f-ca4c4871313d","uuid":"0d187b79-eb73-42d7-b863-6df2ebb5acdd","timestamp":"2026-05-16T11:31:48.682Z"}
